;=============================================================================
; Task Monitor (taskmon) - Built-in Layout
;=============================================================================
; IMPORTANT:
; This is a reference copy of a layout built into taskmon. taskmon doesn't
; load it, and puts it back as shipped each time it starts, so any changes
; made here are lost.
;
; To make your own layout, use the Layout Designer in Setup (F2), or copy
; this file into the layouts folder, one level up, under a new name and
; header. A custom layout can't use the name of a built-in layout, and a
; layout file without "version=2", or with another version, is skipped.
;=============================================================================
[Network Send and Receive Bytes Large]
; A split tree (see SummaryControlLayout). Each node is one of:
;   split,<Row|Column>,<ratio>,<first>,<second>  - Row = side by side, Column = stacked,
;                                                   ratio = the first child's share
;   pane,<control>[,<process columns joined with +>]
; Network Sent and Received side by side over the process list, the charts taking 80% of the
; height.
version=2
root=0
nodes=0,1,2,3,4
node.0=split,Column,0.8,1,2
node.1=split,Row,0.5,3,4
node.2=pane,Process
node.3=pane,NetworkSent
node.4=pane,NetworkReceived
